</style>
<h3>⚠️ Important: update as soon as possible</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fans stay at full speed during a temperature safety trip. Before, they could drop back to automatic while the CPU was still hot.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>When the fan helper starts or the Mac wakes, it no longer releases the fans while a safety trip is holding them at full speed.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
