  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<h3>⚠️ Important: update as soon as possible</h3>
<ul>
<li>Installing an update now works while Settings or another panel is open. Before, Install and Relaunch could do nothing until the panel was closed.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Install and Relaunch closes any open panels and installs the update.</li>
<li>Scheduled update alerts come to the front, so they are not missed behind other windows.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
